    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> be a function which satisfies&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />is equal to",
