  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p>On comparing both the equations of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Adding equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> and equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Add equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
